OL,3,GNEWSADecision on 160,000-bird chicken
OL,4,Afarm put on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision on plans for a chicken farm
OL,7,Fhousing up to 160,000 birds has been
OL,8,Fput on hold after fresh concerns were
OL,9,Fraised about the scheme's environmental
OL,10,Fassessment.
OL,12,FThe proposal for land south-west of
OL,13,FManor Farm in Sheriffhales, near
OL,14,FShifnal, Shropshire, would see four
OL,15,Fpoultry houses built, each
OL,16,Faccommodating up to 40,000 birds.
OL,18,FPlanning officers for Shropshire
OL,19,FCouncil have recommended approval,
OL,20,Fsaying environmental assessments found
OL,21,Fodour impacts would be minimal and
OL,22,Foperational noise levels low.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
